3
00:00:06,937 --> 00:00:08,867
(sword fight sound effects
on video game)

4
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:12,637
(Bernadette:)Hey. You got a minute?

5
00:00:12,635 --> 00:00:13,765
(Howard:)Not really.

6
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:17,100
(Howard:)Visigoths are kind of up my butt
right now.

7
00:00:17,106 --> 00:00:19,036
(Bernadette:)Pause the game, Howard.

8
00:00:19,042 --> 00:00:20,612
“Howard”? Uh-oh.

9
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:23,210
(Howard:)Make room, Visigoths.

10
00:00:23,746 --> 00:00:25,416
'Sup?

11
00:00:25,415 --> 00:00:27,655
(Bernadette:)We need to talk
about redecorating this place.

12
00:00:27,656 --> 00:00:30,586
(Howard:)Oh, no, not this again.
Look,

13
00:00:30,586 --> 00:00:33,586
(Bernadette:)I get that you grew up here
and you're attached to things

14
00:00:33,589 --> 00:00:34,919
(Sheldon:)looking
a certain way, but...

15
00:00:34,924 --> 00:00:37,564
(Bernadette:)I want this to feel
like my house, too.

16
00:00:37,564 --> 00:00:40,194
(Howard:)Oh, honey, of course
it's your house.

17
00:00:40,196 --> 00:00:43,396
(Howard:)Why else would you
be cleaning it all the time?

18
00:00:43,399 --> 00:00:45,569
(chuckles)

19
00:00:45,568 --> 00:00:47,468
(Bernadette:)All right.
Let's start over.

20
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:48,770
(Bernadette:)I'm redecorating.

21
00:00:48,771 --> 00:00:50,901
(Bernadette:)The furniture,
the carpeting, the walls.

22
00:00:50,907 --> 00:00:53,737
(Bernadette:)I'm changing everything that
depresses me when I look at it.

23
00:00:53,743 --> 00:00:55,813
(Bernadette:)Try not to be one
of those things.

24
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:58,379
(Howard:)May I say something?

25
00:00:58,381 --> 00:01:00,411
(Bernadette:)Is it about how I can't have
new wallpaper

26
00:01:00,416 --> 00:01:02,816
(Bernadette:)'cause your dad left when you
were little and your mom died?

